:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Rider (Enemy)]].''
'''Rider''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 367
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Rider
|name2 = Rider CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Rider CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Rider can be used in the same way as [[Ice Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Ice Cat]], except for [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies. While her stats are worse, she is still able to permanently freeze Angel enemies just as efficiently. She performs a lot better than [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet Cat]] and [[Cat Toaster (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Toaster]] along with being able to make many Angel heavy stages a lot easier.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Backliner}}

